  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3313.03 Failure to Pay Renewal Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3313.03 Failure to Pay Renewal Fee. Any agency or approved manufacturer that fails to pay the renewal fee within 180 days of the annual anniversary date of approval shall reapply and be examined as an initial approval.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10 (from Saf-C 3310.08); ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
